        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, this is not an issue in any of statusline plugins but `cmdheight=0` itself, because this is reproducible even without one with this 'init.lua':\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<a-l>\", \"<cmd><cr>\", {silent=true})\r\nvim.opt.cmdheight=0\r\n```\r\n\r\n'Noice.nvim' doesn't have this because it overrides how `cmdheight=0` acts under the hood.",
